abapfmt

abapfmt is an ABAP code formatter. It adopts the formatting options and behaviour
of ABAP cleaner, an Eclipse/Java plugin originally developed by SAP:

    https://github.com/SAP/abap-cleaner

ABAP cleaner is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    Copyright 2023 SAP SE or an SAP affiliate company and ABAP cleaner
    contributors

Material derived from ABAP cleaner distributed in this repository:

  - `fixtures/rules/` - JSON test fixtures mechanically derived from upstream
    JUnit test source (v1.29.0) by `tools/import-java-fixtures.mjs`.
  - `fixtures/samples/` - byte-identical copies of the sample files under
    upstream `vscode-extension/samples/`.
  - Rust code ported from upstream Java (via the earlier TypeScript port) carries
    a `// Ported from <upstream file> @ v1.29.0` header.

